---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const metadata = {
  title: 'Sponsor',
  description: 'Learn how you can sponsor my blog and support high-quality content on software development, systems thinking, psychological insights, and personal growth.',
};
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-12 sm:py-16 md:px-6 lg:py-20">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">Sponsor Me</h1>
    <p>
      Thank you for your interest in supporting my blog. Your sponsorship helps me continue to provide high-quality content on software development, systems thinking, psychological insights, and personal growth. Below, you'll find detailed information on how you can become a sponsor and the benefits of partnering with me.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">About My Blog</h2>
    <p>My blog is dedicated to:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc ml-6">
      <li><strong>Software Development:</strong> Focusing on TDD, Continuous Delivery, Design Patterns, Clean Code, Spring Boot, and React.</li>
      <li><strong>Life:</strong> Exploring frameworks, philosophies and mental models to optimize life.</li>
      <li><strong>Business <sup>(new)</sup>:</strong> Exploring frameworks, philosophies and mental models to optimize business.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">Why Sponsor Me?</h2>
    <p>By sponsoring my blog, you'll be:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc ml-6">
      <li><strong>Reaching a Targeted Audience:</strong> My readers are software developers, systems thinkers, and individuals interested in personal development and psychological insights.</li>
      <li><strong>Supporting Quality Content:</strong> Your sponsorship enables me to create more in-depth articles, tutorials, and resources.</li>
      <li><strong>Enhancing Your Brand:</strong> Align your brand with high-quality content and a dedicated community.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">Sponsorship Opportunities</h2>
    <p>I offer various sponsorship options to suit your needs:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc ml-6">
      <li><strong>Banner Ads</strong>
        <ul class="list-disc ml-6">
          <li><strong>Header Banner:</strong> Featured prominently at the top of each page.</li>
          <li><strong>Sidebar Banner:</strong> Visible on all blog pages, ensuring continuous exposure.</li>
          <li><strong>In-Content Banner:</strong> Placed within blog posts for targeted visibility.</li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li><strong>Sponsored Posts</strong>
        <ul class="list-disc ml-6">
          <li><strong>Feature Article:</strong> A dedicated post highlighting your brand or product, crafted in collaboration with my editorial team.</li>
          <li><strong>Product Reviews:</strong> Honest and detailed reviews of your product or service.</li>
        </ul>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">Testimonial</h3>

    <img src="/images/sponsor-example.png" alt="Sponsorship Example" class="my-8 mx-auto max-w-full rounded shadow-lg" />

    <bold>July 2024</bold>
    <blockquote class="mt-6 italic border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-4">
      “Thank you so much for adding the banner — that is more than perfect!”<br />
      <span class="font-bold">— Manager, MongoDB</span>
    </blockquote>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">Get in Touch</h2>
    <p>
      Interested in becoming a sponsor? I’d love to hear from you! Please reach out to me at <a href="mailto:ankushchoubey@outlook.com" class="text-blue-600 underline">ankushchoubey@outlook.com</a> with your sponsorship inquiries. I will provide you with detailed information on my rates and tailor a sponsorship package to meet your goals.
    </p>
    <p>
      Thank you for considering sponsorship opportunities with my blog. Your support is invaluable in helping me continue to create and share valuable content with my community.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
